{"id":"the-helmsman","name":"The Helmsman","type":"Sniper Rifle","tier":"Legendary","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/5dbd83b694c315c8693aa5c9ddcf2df7.jpg","screenshot":"/common/destiny2_content/screenshots/2325078119.jpg","columns":[{"label":"Barrel","weight":1,"perks":[{"name":"Arrowhead Brake","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/8f7fb54687aa52a9c2595d90ce9c9417.png","desc":"Lightly vented barrel.\n  •  Greatly controls recoil\n  •  Increases handling speed"},{"name":"Chambered Compensator","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0b451cbccc7f11f6aec9c153e59474cb.png","desc":"Stable barrel attachment.\n  •  Increases stability\n  •  Moderately controls recoil\n  •  Slightly decreases handling speed"},{"name":"Corkscrew Rifling","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7730e1732ed7ef91afce50277639c493.png","desc":"Balanced barrel. \n  •  Slightly increases range and stability\n  •  Slightly increases handling speed"},{"name":"Extended Barrel","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/d9e5e8fa07a84c29252b78b0e7b3106d.png","desc":"Weighty barrel extension.\n  •  Increases range\n  •  Decreases handling speed\n  •  Moderately controls recoil"},{"name":"Fluted Barrel","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/260eba9dd149dbb94b1306c9ed4dd8db.png","desc":"Ultra-light barrel. \n  •  Greatly increases handling speed\n  •  Slightly increases stability"},{"name":"Full Bore","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/40a4bdcf0f5a4e492927f9569eaf529d.png","desc":"Barrel optimized for distance.\n  •  Greatly increases range\n  •  Decreases stability\n  •  Slightly decreases handling speed"},{"name":"Hammer-Forged Rifling","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/2b9eb6d4489cffc18c10223279198bcc.png","desc":"Durable ranged barrel.\n  •  Increases range"},{"name":"Polygonal Rifling","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7d7aaccee29cf450d4057a9de871cdc8.png","desc":"Barrel optimized for recoil reduction.\n  •  Increases stability"},{"name":"Smallbore","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7d1bb6a623f14959a47156ee71acfc3a.png","desc":"Dual strength barrel.\n  •  Increases range\n  •  Increases stability"},{"name":"Full Choke","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/629246e67fc8690d56b5478b0262131a.png","desc":"Tightened barrel. Reduces projectile spread when aiming down sights at the cost of precision damage."},{"name":"Rifled Barrel","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/79d5f1f469d3290cfb849f4b3e6fc16b.png","desc":"Ranged shotgun barrel.\n  •  Increases range\n  •  Greatly decreases handling speed"}]},{"label":"Magazine","weight":1,"perks":[{"name":"Accurized Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/d85024478504205359c7fb52dbc4f6b6.png","desc":"This weapon can fire longer distances.\n  •  Increases range"},{"name":"Appended Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/d9f468cce26fe35d9db413e2f8451127.png","desc":"This weapon's magazine is built for higher capacity.\n  •  Increases magazine size"},{"name":"Tactical Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/f0e309a267b25279a871d182f8910bcc.png","desc":"This weapon has multiple tactical improvements.\n  •  Slightly increases stability\n  •  Increases reload speed\n  •  Slightly increases magazine size"},{"name":"Extended Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/66cfea124e24e73cca1ce6370b44ca7e.png","desc":"This weapon has a greatly increased magazine size, but reloads much slower.\n  •  Greatly increases magazine size\n  •  Greatly decreases reload speed\n  •  Increases airborne effectiveness"},{"name":"Steady Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/6c6e1cc341487a8afd0b0c714a229255.png","desc":"This magazine is optimized for recoil control.\n  •  Greatly increases stability \n  •  Slightly decreases range\n  •  Increases airborne effectiveness"},{"name":"Alloy Magazine","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/069170916c98748b7b3e33b80bd7d689.png","desc":"Faster reload when the magazine is nearly empty."},{"name":"Flared Magwell","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/f95e67e4ff37466505d66d3fa1030782.png","desc":"Optimized for fast reloading.\n  •  Slightly increases stability\n  •  Greatly increases reload speed"}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"No Distractions","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/3f6534e7fd934e0ecfeb1cac9da9c97f.png","desc":"Aiming this weapon for a short period reduces flinch."},{"name":"Light Touch","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/46b000a4e8c4ffa73df16c26a63360e0.png","desc":"This weapon gains reload speed, handling, and aim down sight speed when you are amplified, radiant, or have Devour."},{"name":"Snapshot Sights","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/ce16c9e2cbd73bb548af3e15bdfc7177.png","desc":"Faster time to aim down sights."},{"name":"Lone Wolf","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/4c244b847778a484726543e5c35935ef.png","desc":"Slightly improves aim assist, aim down sights speed, and airborne effectiveness. Increases these effects when there are no nearby allies."},{"name":"Explosive Payload","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/31f02e5f3bae68ecdfdd3f899cf931c7.png","desc":"Projectiles create an area-of-effect detonation on impact."},{"name":"Discord","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/3112a65a875b759a21ab94b832d04279.png","desc":"Final blows with another weapon grant this weapon increased speed for aiming down sights, accuracy, and airborne effectiveness for a short time. When Discord is active, final blows refund ammo."}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"Box Breathing","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/ef9c0dbddcb4c51fe5d3768e26b73746.png","desc":"Aiming this weapon for a short period without firing grants bonus range and precision damage that resets after firing or exiting zoom."},{"name":"Gear Shift","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/a9d69d341b43e53428546d2090c63ae8.png","desc":"Reloading after a final blow or becoming amplified grants a period of increased damage. Stacks 5x."},{"name":"Opening Shot","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/276e8ce23910c6ee2a6b88b076a2004c.png","desc":"Improved accuracy and range on the opening shot of attack."},{"name":"Closing Time","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/8a31da21e65dd889eb96b7e0b135bbbe.png","desc":"Improves range, accuracy, and handling as the magazine gets lower."},{"name":"Vorpal Weapon","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/bc5130b227ee577f2678ec2d2c97bf4a.png","desc":"Increased damage against bosses, vehicles, and Guardians with their Super active."},{"name":"Elemental Honing","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/ac0323ff44f720a8db7ae9f4dee59af4.png","desc":"Dealing unique elemental damage grants this weapon a stacking damage bonus. This bonus is increased for kinetic weapons."}]},{"label":"Origin Trait","weight":0.5,"perks":[{"name":"Roar of Battle","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/e2157adc16129c403e63024ff475482b.png","desc":"Being in combat for a short duration increases handling and stability."},{"name":"Field-Tested","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7e36e16a1487ac287966a4cdb965e6df.png","desc":"Defeating targets or dealing damage with this weapon gradually increases range, stability, handling, and reload speed.\n\nSwords gain increased charge rate and guard resistance."},{"name":"Accelerated Assault","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0fe2a63b375af0d8b17ccee5ad65415b.png","desc":"Dealing sustained damage with this weapon increases reload speed and Sword charge rate and slightly increases damage."}]}],"notes":[],"estimated":{"basis":"Sniper Rifles","weapons":63,"rolls":6760},"modes":{"all":{"rolls":[[4,11,20],[4,11,26],[0,11,20],[0,11,26],[0,20],[4,20],[4,13,20],[4,12,28],[0,12,28],[0,13,20],[4,13,26],[0,13,26],[6,11,20],[0,13,28],[4,13,28],[6,11,26],[6,13,20],[6,13,26],[4,14,28],[0,14,28],[6,20],[2,11,20],[4,17,28],[2,11,26],[0,17,28],[2,12,28],[2,13,28],[4,17,20],[2,20],[0,17,20],[2,14,28],[2,17,20],[4,13,22],[0,13,22],[4,12,22],[2,13,20],[4,11,20,26],[4,20,26],[0,20,26],[4,26],[0,26],[8,11,20],[8,20],[0,12,22],[4,11,18],[4,11,18,20],[8,